  "description": "Become a king of gravel without spending a fortune! The BACKROAD AL APEX 1x11 shows you the way! The basis is the high-quality frame of the BACKROAD AL family – with triple-butted tubes, lightweight, torsion-resistant, featuring beautiful details like a downtube protector against flying stones, an elegantly integrated seat clamp as well as ground and filled welds that give the bike a stylish carbon look. The carbon fork is a perfect match: for a comfortable ride and an elegant look. What’s more, the bike has a top-notch groupset – the Apex 1 by Sram. 11 gears offer a wide range, while the X-Horizon technology reduces shifting forces and prevents chain slap with an exactly parallel rear derailleur. High-quality components like DT Swiss P1850 Spline Disc system wheels or a Selle Italia X3 Flow saddle make sure the BACKROAD AL APEX 1x11 is incredible value for money! * approx. 9.3 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for roasted olive frame, 57 cm, without pedals",
